Speaker 0: my watch has one face has the weather and another face shows the clocks in all those same time zones because I talk to people in like 5 different time zones every day.

590
00:50:27,492 --> 00:50:34,382
Speaker 1: but yeah people keep you know pushing these things hard but it's good to have them but they're not way too much.

